scrollcraft/builds/*/assets/*.mp4
scrollcraft/builds/*/assets/*.jpg

# Source recordings. Kept out of git for two reasons.
#
# Size: demo-own-placaok.MP4 alone is 103MB, over GitHub's hard 100MB limit,
# and the directory is 394MB. It cannot be pushed as-is.
#
# Content: these are unwindowed production captures and this repository is
# public. The site ships only tight windows of them, chosen deliberately -
# cocap stops before its photo picker, Platanitos before its account screen,
# Itau at 2.9s, placaok before its share sheet. See the REDACTION block at the
# top of scrollcraft/builds/one-device/encode.sh. The masters carry what those
# windows exist to exclude, so they stay on the machine that made them.
#
# encode.sh documents every file it needs and the exact window it takes.
resources/
